OL,3,GNEWSATurning 100 with a belly dancer
OL,4,Aand WW2 jeep
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhat do you get someone who reaches
OL,7,Ftheir century milestone? A belly dance
OL,8,Fand a ride in a WW2 jeep, of course.
OL,10,FColin Bargh is described as "true gent
OL,11,Fwith a lovely sense of humour" by care
OL,12,Fstaff at Riverdale Care Home in
OL,13,FChesterfield, and they wanted the RAF
OL,14,Fveteran's big day to be special.
OL,16,FColin said he liked to "do these things
OL,17,Fto keep the kids out of trouble"
OL,18,Freferring to his fellow care home
OL,19,Fresidents.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
