OL,3,GNEWSATurning 100 with a belly dancer
OL,4,Aand WW2 jeep
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter the belly dancing performance,
OL,7,Fhis son, Ian Bargh, said: "She was
OL,8,Fexcellent, it was very good indeed. My
OL,9,Fdad enjoyed it, he's always enjoyed
OL,10,Fanything with girls like that, he loves
OL,11,Fit."
